@page "/info"

<LogoTitle Title="About Streamline" ShowBackArrow="true" BackUrl="@AppRoutes.ProfileUrl"/>

<div class="about-container">
    <p class="mt-3">
        The aim of the <strong>Streamline app</strong> is to provide users with a central platform for managing their
        films and series. Users can organize their watchlist, document content they have already watched, and enter
        ratings or notes on films and series.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3">
        Typical processes include:
    </p>
    <ul class="mb-3">
        <li>Adding new titles to the watchlist</li>
        <li>Marking completed series</li>
        <li>Rating and categorizing content</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">
        <strong>Streamline</strong> is mainly used in a private environment, such as:
    </p>
    <ul class="mb-3">
        <li>At home on the sofa</li>
        <li>On the move with a smartphone</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">
        The app offers:
    </p>
    <ul class="mb-3">
        <li>Storage and management of user data</li>
        <li>Recommendations based on the watchlist</li>
        <li>Synchronization across multiple devices</li>
        <li>The ability to share lists with friends to exchange recommendations</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        <strong>Our mission:</strong> Streamline is designed to impress with a simple and user-friendly interface,
        ensuring accessibility even for less tech-savvy users. It is perfect for streaming enthusiasts who consume films
        and series regularly and want to document their viewing experiences in a structured way.
    </p>
</div>

